{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16800","headline":"行县至浮查山寺 · 罗珦","name":"行县至浮查山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十年前此布衣，鹿鸣西上虎符归。\n行时宾从过前寺，到处松杉长旧围。\n野老竞遮官道拜，沙鸥遥避隼旟飞。\n春风一宿琉璃地，自有泉声惬素机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗珦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16800.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16800","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}